# Lean · Speed · SEO (LOCKED)

Apply in **every** phase. No exceptions.

## Stack reminder (NO VPS)
- Admin Vite → Hostinger · API Laravel → Hostinger MySQL · Storefront Next → Vercel · Media R2/CDN.
- Details: `docs/02-tech-stack-no-vps.md`. No VPS dependency in this phase.

## Ultra-fast / no full refresh / ZERO stale cache
- Mutations → optimistic UI + query invalidation / cache bust — not `location.reload()` or hard remount of the whole app.
- Prefer TanStack Query invalidate by tag scoped to `store_id`: products, orders, categories, theme, SEO, media.
- Next.js ISR: `revalidateTag` / `revalidatePath` after publish — never leave old HTML/products/prices.
- Images: hashed URL or `?v={updated_at}` — overwritten same URL without bust = forbidden. No old cached image anywhere.
- CDN/cache keys always store-scoped. DB is source of truth; on conflict DB wins.
- Realtime only where needed (orders, stock, theme publish). No blanket listeners on every page.
- Toasts for success/error (~3–4s). Button `aria-busy` on submit. Never freeze the whole page.
- Nav = soft SPA transitions. No native `alert()` / `confirm()`.

## Public web SEO (mandatory)
- Storefront SEO is **full** and **per-store**: title, description, slug, canonical, OG, Twitter, JSON-LD, sitemap, robots, hreflang, alt text.
- Prefer SSR/prerender for public pages (Next storefront). Client-only meta is not enough for production SEO.
- Keyword stuffing / fake backlinks / ranking guarantees = forbidden.
- Unknown traffic sources must not be mis-attributed.

## Lean product
- One prompt/slice at a time. Ship only unlocked screens.
- Real data paths over fake charts once persistence exists.
- Master feature grants + plan limits enforced **server-side**, not only hidden buttons.
